longdesc The package modifies the way the latin option to babel operates
longdesc when typesetting Latin. The style is somewhat 'frenchified' in
longdesc respect of punctuation spacings and footnote style; shortcuts
longdesc are available in order to set accents on all vowels, including
longdesc y and the diphthongs ae and oe.
